# Build profile: the build tools of every step when the tools setting
# names an extras reference (BUILD.md "Build tools"), in place of
# host-base: the base stage's tools from the pos reference, the rest
# pos-extras', in its prefix. A package's own requirements come first; a
# tool it does not require is the references' copy.
kind profile
requires bash coreutils findutils gawk grep sed tar gzip xz zstd bzip2 cpio file which curl
requires make m4 autoconf automake autoconf-archive libtool pkgconf
requires bison flex gperf texinfo help2man gettext-tools
requires perl python3 git diffutils patch patchelf
